{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Sector 404</strong>, you play as a man returning home late at night. The block is quiet\u2014too quiet. You take your <strong>medicine</strong> like always, but something\u2019s wrong. The stairwell feels <strong>endless</strong>, the air feels heavy and unseen eyes seem to <strong>follow</strong> your every step.\u00a0You need to get <strong>home</strong>. But the building has other plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Starting at the ground floor, your <strong>goal</strong> is simple: reach your apartment on the tenth. But the floors hide <strong>anomalies</strong>\u2014distortions in sound, space, or logic. Miss them, and you\u2019re pulled back to the <strong>start</strong>. <strong>Again</strong>. And <strong>again</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You <strong>must</strong> watch every shadow, listen to <strong>every</strong> sound, and notice the <strong>smallest</strong> things\u2014because <strong>missing</strong> even one detail could mean you <strong>never</strong> make it home.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With over 70 unique <strong>anomalies</strong> scattered throughout the block, no two games are ever the <strong>same</strong>. Stay sharp\u2014your survival depends on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re not sure what\u2019s worse\u2014the things you\u2019re seeing, or the feeling that you\u2019ve seen them before. What if you\u2019ve already made it home\u2014and this is what it looks like now?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3431930?t=1751233337","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3431930?t=1751233337","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431930/57bf64bc0b72eabc0dd284364590e147dc50128c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751233337","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431930/57bf64bc0b72eabc0dd284364590e147dc50128c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751233337","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Sector 404</strong>, you play as a man returning home late at night. The block is quiet\u2014too quiet. You take your <strong>medicine</strong> like always, but something\u2019s wrong. The stairwell feels <strong>endless</strong>, the air feels heavy and unseen eyes seem to <strong>follow</strong> your every step.\u00a0You need to get <strong>home</strong>. But the building has other plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Starting at the ground floor, your <strong>goal</strong> is simple: reach your apartment on the tenth. But the floors hide <strong>anomalies</strong>\u2014distortions in sound, space, or logic. Miss them, and you\u2019re pulled back to the <strong>start</strong>. <strong>Again</strong>. And <strong>again</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You <strong>must</strong> watch every shadow, listen to <strong>every</strong> sound, and notice the <strong>smallest</strong> things\u2014because <strong>missing</strong> even one detail could mean you <strong>never</strong> make it home.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With over 70 unique <strong>anomalies</strong> scattered throughout the block, no two games are ever the <strong>same</strong>. Stay sharp\u2014your survival depends on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re not sure what\u2019s worse\u2014the things you\u2019re seeing, or the feeling that you\u2019ve seen them before. What if you\u2019ve already made it home\u2014and this is what it looks like now?</p>","developers":["Empty Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431930/b05d2b8a3bf2451768f640654e94449d915875c5/header.jpg?t=1751233337","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257085522,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257085522/movie480.mp4?t=1749287037","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257085522/movie_max.mp4?t=1749287037"},"name":"Sector 404 Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257085522/07d9f53db581ad5ee20522e1b28543906d52532c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749287037","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257085522/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749287037","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257085522/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749287037"}}],"name":"Sector 404","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-4590 3.3GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Empty Studio"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia\nMedo","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Horror","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steam